      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-7631-7852"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7634-7661"><rb>少年</rb><rt>しょうねん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7661-7673">は、こう</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7673-7685"><rb>問</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7685-7694">うと、</seg><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-7721-7769"><lem><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7694-7721"><rb>少女</rb><rt>しょうじょ</rt></ruby></lem><rdg type="base-text"><seg source="#source-7757-7763">小女</seg></rdg></app><seg source="#source-7769-7775">は、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7775-7790"><rb>顔</rb><rt>かお</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7790-7793">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7793-7808"><rb>赤</rb><rt>あか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7808-7852">くしながら、うなずきました。</seg></p>
